{"id":"626004","name":"老面馒头","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/626004/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"温水","amount":"300g"},{"name":"老面","amount":"1块"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"老面。","img":"images/626004/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放温水和面粉。","img":"images/626004/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"images/626004/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放温暖出发酵。","img":"images/626004/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"发好的面取出来，分成小剂子。","img":"images/626004/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉成馒头，每个馒头我都揉棵至少60下，累的我胳膊酸。","img":"images/626004/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放温暖处发酵。","img":"images/626004/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"二次发好的馒头放蒸笼里。","img":"images/626004/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"入蒸锅。","img":"images/626004/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火烧开，改中火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/626004/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"焖5～10分钟。","img":"images/626004/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/626004/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}